                                            {
                                                "example_id": "111ba0b6-6d05-408c-8016-963d439e4cf9",
                                                "sense_id": "4c5c9f23-2488-355c-835c-f739df8b16bc",
                                                "text": "The top anti-corruption watchdog in Southwest China’s Yunnan province said on Friday the governor of the burgeoning aluminium hub of Wenshan had been placed under investigation.\nZhang Xiulan, who has been governor of Wenshan prefecture since March 2015, is suspected of “grave violations of discipline and the law,” the Yunnan Province Commission for Discipline Inspection said in a statement, without elaborating."
                                            },
